    "notes": {
        "ce754c3b-fd4b-44a9-b93d-0b4da36908ae": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 16,
            "width": 896,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption — ServiceNow business rules\n\nThe NewRecord / UpdatedRecord / DeletedRecord triggers only fire when the ServiceNow instance POSTs events to the Appmixer plugin route `<API_URL>/plugins/appmixer/servicenow/events`.\n\n1. Connect the ServiceNow account **with a Webhook Secret** (at least 16 characters) — the triggers refuse to start without it.\n2. On the instance, create async business rules on the `incident` table for insert, update and delete that POST `{\"type\": \"<instance>.incident.<insert|update|delete>\", \"data\": <record JSON>}` with the header `X-Appmixer-Secret: <the same secret>`.\n3. Keep the 1 minute Wait — the listeners must be registered before the provoking actions run.\n\nWithout the business rules the flow times out in AfterAll (600 s)."
        }
    }
